<title>POLAND: PLI trades on kerb at PLN 11.4.</title>
<headline>PLI trades on kerb at PLN 11.4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 350,000 shares in wholesaler and retailer Polish Life Improvement SA (PLI) at 11.4 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, PLI traded at 10.2 zlotys in a volume of 10,038 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
